### Test 8: GET user by ID (avec token)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Test 9: GET user by email (avec token)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/users/by-email?email=bb@test.com
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### Test 10: GET multiple users by IDs
POST http://localhost:8081/api/users/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ids": [1, 2, 3]
}

###

### Test 11: Login admin
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin1@test.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

> {% 
    client.global.set("auth_token_admin", response.body.token);
%}

###

### Test 12: GET all user info with admin token
GET http://localhost:8081/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token_admin}}